    tryIt: 'the tool buttons, target device picker, count stepper, the level chips on the log, Tweaks > stage success and failure, role viewer (tools still run, they do not change the router).',
    real: 'the app tools screen (ping, traceroute and name lookup run on the router) and the logs screen.', unbuilt: 'Live latency line, the drawn trace path and live log streaming are design only.',
